arthandas1@gmail.com wrote:
> Is it possible to display the corridor borders?

3.4.3's engine doesn't distinguish between stone (corridor border) and
unexplore area, and as far as I know, that hasn't been changed in
UnNethack. (There's actually an option to display corridor boulders in
3.4.3, incidentally, but it doesn't actually work; trying to enable it
just corrupts the screen.)

NetHack4's engine can distinguish between them; currently it draws
stone and unexplored the same way in ASCII/Unicode mode, but differently
in the experimental tiles port. This can theoretically be customized in
ASCII/Unicode, but I haven't tried yet.

